OL,3,AChild abuse trial of snooker champion
OL,4,AGraeme Dott hears closing arguments
OL,5,
OL,6,FDott's lawyer, Euan Dow, said emotions
OL,7,Fin such cases were natural, and urged
OL,8,Fjurors to not to decide the verdicts on
OL,9,F"hunches" or "suspicions".
